              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-0{,}5;1{,}2;2{,}5\\}\"></span> .</p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T05:15:46.539951+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Не­ра­вен­ство имеет смысл при  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}x-\\frac{2}{3}\\ne 0\"></span>,  то есть при <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\ne 1\"></span>.</p><p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left|\\frac{2}{3}x-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|.^{(x-1{,}2)}=t\"></span>.  Тогда не­ра­вен­ство при­ни­ма­ет вид <span data-inline-latex=\"t+\\frac{1}{t}\\le 2\"></span>,  от­ку­да <span data-inline-latex=\"t=1\"></span>  или <span data-inline-latex=\"t\\lt 0\"></span>. При всех до­пу­сти­мых <i>x</i> ос­но­ва­ние сте­пе­ни по­ло­жи­тель­но и, сле­до­ва­тель­но, <span data-inline-latex=\"t\\gt 0\"></span>. Зна­чит, не­ра­вен­ство вы­пол­ня­ет­ся толь­ко при <span data-inline-latex=\"t=1\"></span>.</p><p>Вы­яс­ним, при каких <i>x</i> это про­ис­хо­дит:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"\\left|\\frac{2}{3}x-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|^{x-1{,}2}=1\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\left|\\frac{2}{3}x-\\frac{2}{3}\\right|=1\\\\\\begin{cases}x-1{,}2=0\\\\\\frac{2}{3}x-\\frac{2}{3}\\ne 0\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=2{,}5\\\\x=1{,}2\\\\x=-0{,}5\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
          {
